[agent:result]     Warning: External Feature Group Engine Support
[agent:result]         **Spark only**
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]         Reading a Query containing an External Feature Group directly into a
[agent:result]         Pandas Dataframe using Python/Pandas as Engine is not supported,
[agent:result]         however, you can use the Query API to create Feature Views/Training
[agent:result]         Data containing External Feature Groups.
[agent:result] 
[agent:result]     Example: Reading with filters and time-based filtering:
[agent:result]         ```python
[agent:result]         fg = fs.get_feature_group(...)
[agent:result]         # Using strings
